    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>By enabling hierarchies of IoT Edge devices through the automation pyramid, industrials can collect data from their systems, aggregate it, and forward it to the cloud without compromising their systems. The device management and communication functionalities of a single IoT Edge device have also been extended to work through hierarchies of IoT Edge devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This IoT Edge solution adds to other significant advancements that make it easier for you to benefit from IoT, including <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.microsoft.com%2Fsecurity%2Fblog%2F2021%2F01%2F27%2Fannouncing-the-general-availability-of-azure-defender-for-iot%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101286651%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=5Q0zKDfvuP8rzpBWIRfP7znSao%2Be008k6M1AJBdh14Y%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Defender for IoT</a>, <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftechcommunity.microsoft.com%2Ft5%2Finternet-of-things%2Fsecure-your-iot-edge-compute-today-with-enclaves%2Fba-p%2F1685143&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101286651%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=nRTMhABpVH2aTzuTKwExBhfrUpjaScGoLhtAOC2p2O0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure IoT Edge security enclaves</a>, <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftechcommunity.microsoft.com%2Ft5%2Finternet-of-things%2Fstreamline-device-management-with-device-update-for-iot-hub-now%2Fba-p%2F2167663&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101296606%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=OniJ%2FPRxtLRKar7JOkp6rq%2FiK0uY4DyOsgCHYJtnBks%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Device Update for IoT Hub</a>, and <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fservices%2Fdigital-twins%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101296606%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=23HouUtxZvlRpR86RB0Lu%2Fmv4ZS0Xhjuah5NWPXeUY4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Digital Twins</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about this new solution from this <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fiotedge-nested-tutorial&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101306567%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=NQimFOoRpwgWWkF0ND7tDqLgfavbUtMCxhvDr4didck%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nested IoT Edge tutorial</a> and <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure-Samples%2Fiot-edge-for-iiot&amp;data=04%7C01%7Cv-loconr%40microsoft.com%7C9f163fa70503401729a808d8f8829a27%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637532587101306567%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=X5TCFAcefdAKq87U55UYJR6iPW5MTxdhSGtuN9KtCH0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sample on GitHub</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Azure-Samples/iot-edge-for-iiot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Find samples on GitHub</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/iot-edge/tutorial-nested-iot-edge?view=iotedge-2020-11&amp;tabs=azure-portal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore with a tutorial</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "By enabling hierarchies of IoT Edge devices through the automation pyramid, industrials can collect data from their systems, aggregate it, and forward it to the cloud without compromising their systems. The device management and communication functionalities of a single IoT Edge device have also been extended to work through hierarchies of IoT Edge devices.\n\nThis IoT Edge solution adds to other significant advancements that make it easier for you to benefit from IoT, including Azure Defender for IoT , Azure IoT Edge security enclaves , Device Update for IoT Hub , and Azure Digital Twins .\n\nLearn more about this new solution from this nested IoT Edge tutorial and sample on GitHub .\n\nFind samples on GitHub .\n\nExplore with a tutorial ."
  },
